{"sha": "c9ade0a59e0d3902c0f8736786899e09a1d3bab51db3032f41ee8871aa52818e", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b3:fouriertransform} 章 ---", "傅里叶变换}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:fouriertransform:1}", "$\\widehat{\\mathbf 1_{\\intcc{-a}a}}(\\xi) =", "\\int_{-a}^a\\eu^{-\\iu\\xi x}\\dd x = \\frac{2\\sin(a\\xi)}{\\xi}$", "（$2a$ 为 $0$ 处的值）。", "$\\widehat{\\eu^{-a\\abs x}}(\\xi) = \\int_0^\\infty\\eu^{-(a +", "\\iu\\xi)x} + \\eu^{-(a - \\iu\\xi)x}\\,\\dd x = \\frac1{a + \\iu\\xi} +", "\\frac1{a - \\iu\\xi} = \\frac{2a}{a^2 + \\xi^2}$。", "帐篷函数：$\\max(0, 1 - \\abs x) = \\mathbf 1_{\\intcc{-1/2}{1/2}} *", "\\mathbf 1_{\\intcc{-1/2}{1/2}}$，故其变换为", "$\\bigl(\\frac{2\\sin(\\xi/2)}\\xi\\bigr)^2 =", "\\bigl(\\frac{\\sin(\\xi/2)}{\\xi/2}\\bigr)^2$。", "最后：$\\frac{2a}{a^2+\\xi^2} \\in L^1$，故由反演公式", "（\\cref{thm:b3:fouriertransform:inversion}(2)）作用于", "$\\eu^{-a\\abs x}$，变量换名后得", "\\[", "\\widehat{\\Bigl(\\frac1{x^2 + a^2}\\Bigr)}(\\xi) =", "\\frac{\\pi}{a}\\,\\eu^{-a\\abs\\xi} .", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:fouriertransform:2}", "由\\cref{prop:b3:fouriertransform:basic}可得：", "$\\widehat{f(\\cdot - a)} = \\eu^{-\\iu a\\xi}\\hat f(\\xi)$；", "$\\widehat{f\\cos(b\\cdot)} = \\frac12\\bigl(\\hat f(\\xi - b) + \\hat", "f(\\xi + b)\\bigr)$；", "$\\widehat{f(a\\cdot + b)}(\\xi) = \\frac1a\\,\\eu^{\\iu", "b\\xi/a}\\,\\hat f(\\xi/a)$（$a > 0$）；", "$\\widehat{\\overline{f(-\\cdot)}} = \\overline{\\hat f}$；", "$\\widehat{f * f} = \\hat f^2$。对高斯函数", "（$\\widehat{\\eu^{-x^2}} = \\sqrt\\pi\\eu^{-\\xi^2/4}$）逐条验证都只需一行计算 ---", "例如 $\\eu^{-(x-a)^2}$ 的变换为", "$\\sqrt\\pi\\,\\eu^{-\\iu a\\xi}\\eu^{-\\xi^2/4}$，", "这可由直接计算（配方）加以验证。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:fouriertransform:3}", "(a) $h = \\mathbf 1_{\\intcc{-1}1}*\\mathbf 1_{\\intcc{-1}1}$ 的变换为", "$\\hat h = \\bigl(\\frac{2\\sin\\xi}\\xi\\bigr)^2 \\in L^1$；", "在 $x = 0$ 处应用反演，其中 $h(0) = \\lambda(\\intcc{-1}1\\cap\\intcc{-1}1)", "= 2$：", "\\[", "2 = \\frac1{2\\pi}\\int_\\R\\Bigl(\\frac{2\\sin\\xi}\\xi\\Bigr)^2", "\\dd\\xi", "\\ \\Longrightarrow\\", "\\int_\\R\\Bigl(\\frac{\\sin\\xi}\\xi\\Bigr)^2\\dd\\xi = \\pi ,", "\\]", "与 $\\int_0^\\infty\\frac{\\sin^2}{\\xi^2} =", "\\frac\\pi2$ 相符（见\\cref{pb:b3:lebesgue:1}）。", "", "(b) 取 $f = \\eu^{-\\abs x}$，普朗歇尔等式 $\\int\\abs{\\hat f}^2 =", "2\\pi\\int\\abs f^2$ 即 $\\int\\frac{4\\,\\dd\\xi}{(1 + \\xi^2)^2} =", "2\\pi\\int\\eu^{-2\\abs x}\\dd x = 2\\pi$：", "$\\int_\\R\\frac{\\dd\\xi}{(1+\\xi^2)^2} = \\frac\\pi2$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:fouriertransform:4}", "(a) $g_t(x) = \\frac1{2\\sqrt{\\pi t}}\\eu^{-x^2/4t}$：由", "\\cref{ex:b3:fouriertransform:gaussian}，取 $a = \\frac1{4t}$，", "$\\hat g_t(\\xi) = \\frac1{2\\sqrt{\\pi t}}\\sqrt{4\\pi", "t}\\,\\eu^{-t\\xi^2} = \\eu^{-t\\xi^2}$。", "(b) $\\widehat{g_t * g_s} = \\eu^{-t\\xi^2}\\eu^{-s\\xi^2} =", "\\widehat{g_{t+s}}$，且变换在 $L^1$ 上是单射", "（\\cref{thm:b3:fouriertransform:inversion}(3)），故 $g_t * g_s =", "g_{t+s}$。", "(c) $\\norm{g_t}_1 = 1$（高斯积分）；", "$\\norm{g_t}_2^2 = \\frac1{4\\pi t}\\int\\eu^{-x^2/2t}\\dd x =", "\\frac{\\sqrt{2\\pi t}}{4\\pi t} = \\frac1{\\sqrt{8\\pi t}}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:fouriertransform:5}", "对实偶函数 $f$：$\\hat f(\\xi) = \\int f\\cos(\\xi x)\\dd x$（", "正弦部分相消）：实值且为偶函数。奇函数：$\\hat f(\\xi) =", "-\\iu\\int f\\sin(\\xi x)$：为奇函数且纯虚。$\\hat f(0) =", "\\int f$：即总质量。若 $f \\geq 0$：$\\abs{\\hat f(\\xi)}", "\\leq \\int\\abs f = \\int f = \\hat f(0)$，故上确界在", "$0$ 处取得。对于概率密度，$\\hat f(-\\xi)$ 即", "\\cref{ch:b3:clt}中的特征函数：模长 $\\leq 1$，", "处处成立，且在原点处 $= 1$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b3:fouriertransform:6}", "(i) 单射性由", "\\cref{thm:b3:fouriertransform:inversion}(3)给出；连续性由", "$\\norm{\\hat f}_\\infty \\leq \\norm f_1$ 给出（取值在", "$\\mathcal C_0$ 中，由黎曼–勒贝格引理）；$\\mathcal C_0$ 在", "上确界范数下是闭的（无穷远处趋于零的函数的一致极限，", "仍在无穷远处趋于零）：故为巴拿赫空间。", "", "(ii) 巴拿赫空间之间的连续双射，其", "逆映射连续（\\cref{thm:b3:banach:openmapping}）：存在", "常数 $C$，使得 $\\norm f_1 \\leq C\\norm{\\hat f}_\\infty$。", "", "(iii) 令 $f_n(x) = \\frac{\\sin x}x\\cdot\\frac{\\sin(x/n)}{x/n}$：", "两个 $L^2$ 函数之积，且", "在无穷远处为 $O(x^{-2})$，故 $f_n \\in L^1\\cap L^2$。由于", "$\\bigl(\\frac{\\sin(ax)}{ax}\\bigr)$ 的 $L^2$ 变换为", "$\\frac\\pi a\\mathbf 1_{\\intcc{-a}a}$，乘积公式", "$\\widehat{gh} = \\frac1{2\\pi}\\hat g * \\hat h$（对 $g, h", "\\in L^2$ 且 $gh \\in L^1$ 成立；在施瓦茨函数上用 Fubini 验证，", "再借两端关于 $L^2$ 的连续性推广，依普朗歇尔", "定理）给出", "\\[", "\\hat f_n = \\frac1{2\\pi}\\,\\bigl(\\pi\\mathbf", "1_{\\intcc{-1}1}\\bigr) * \\bigl(\\pi n\\,\\mathbf", "1_{\\intcc{-1/n}{1/n}}\\bigr):", "\\]", "这是一个高为 $\\frac{\\pi n}2\\cdot\\frac2n = \\pi$ 的梯形：", "$\\norm{\\hat f_n}_\\infty = \\pi$ 对每个 $n$ 成立。但在 $[1,", "n]$ 上，$\\frac{\\sin(x/n)}{x/n} \\geq \\sin 1 > 0$，故", "\\[", "\\norm{f_n}_1 \\geq \\sin 1\\int_1^n\\frac{\\abs{\\sin x}}x\\dd x", "\\geq c\\ln n", "\\]", "（拱计数法，见\\cref{thm:b3:banach:fourierdiverge}）。", "界 $\\norm{f_n}_1 \\leq C\\pi$ 对大的 $n$ 不成立，故该映射不是", "满射。（其像是一个稠密的 --- 由", "斯通–魏尔斯特拉斯型论证得到 --- 但为", "$\\mathcal C_0$ 的真子空间。）", "\\end{solution}", ""]}